Hi Linus,

The following changes since commit 7d132055814ef17a6c7b69f342244c410a5e000f:

  Linux 3.10-rc6 (2013-06-15 11:51:07 -1000)

are available in the git repository at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound.git tags/sound-3.10

for you to fetch changes up to e32aa85ab49203104019025eba83f03f88a3a0e3:

  ALSA: hda - Add models for Dell headset jacks (2013-06-17 11:15:56 +0200)

----------------------------------------------------------------

sound fixes for v3.10-rc7

Only driver/device-specific small fixes that are pretty safe to apply:
- USB-audio Android and Logitech webcam fixes
- HD-audio MacBook Air 4,2 quirk
- Complete Dell headset quirk entries that were introduced in 3.10

----------------------------------------------------------------

The merge request slipped just because of my traveling in the last
weeks.  They are no terribly critical fixes but all safe and nice to
be merged in 3.10 final.  And I have no hamster, so nothing to worry.


Thanks!

Takashi

